# Shorup News

**Ground News for Bangladesh** — installable PWA that clusters the same story across Prothom Alo, Daily Star, bdnews24, BBC Bangla, and more. Compare framing, perspective lean, blindspots, rumor flags, and **verify claims** with AI-assisted fact-checking. UI copy is **English + Bangla** where product-facing.

## Repo layout

| Path | Stack |
|------|--------|
| `backend/` | Python 3.11+, FastAPI, SQLAlchemy (async), PostgreSQL (`asyncpg`, **pgvector** + FTS for claims), optional **Redis** + **Celery** (`ingest`, `verification` queues), RSS via `app/services/rss_parser.py`, ingestion in `app/services/rss_ingestion.py`, AI via `app/services/ai_client.py` (Groq default, Gemini optional) |
| `frontend/` | Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, TypeScript, Tailwind, PWA (`@ducanh2912/next-pwa`); optional Supabase auth — barrel `src/lib/supabase.ts` re-exports `supabase/client.ts`, `server.ts`, `service.ts`, `config.ts`; session refresh in `supabase/middleware.ts` |
| `supabase/` | Migrations for profiles, Pro subscriptions, payment tables (PayEurasia checkout planned), user dossiers/alerts (RLS); see `.cursor/rules/supabase.mdc` |
| Root `package.json` | `dev:frontend`, `dev:backend`, `build:frontend`, `lint:frontend`, **`ingest:backend`**, **`worker:backend`**, **`worker:beat`**, **`worker:verification`**, **`stack:up`** / **`stack:down`** |
| `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md` | Production release playbook — deploy order, migrations (backend + Supabase), PWA/chunk reload, rollback, CI hooks |
| `docs/CURSOR_RULES.md` | How to maintain `.cursorrules` and `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` with the codebase |
| `docker-compose.yml` | Local stack: Postgres (pgvector), Redis, API, Celery worker, **beat** (minute tick → scheduled RSS when Redis + scheduler enabled) |

## Data on the frontend

- **Live API**: `api-base.ts` — browser `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` (default `/api/v1` via Next rewrite); server `API_URL` → `http://127.0.0.1:3001/api/v1` (`DEV_BACKEND_ORIGIN`). `api.ts` / `verifications.ts` use `resolveApiBase()`. News: `/articles` (optional `source_id`, optional **`image_url`** from RSS), `/sources` (`custom_only` for admin-added feeds), `/clusters`, `/clusters/{slug}` (articles + **`source_name`** / **`bias_score`**), `/bias`, `/rumors`. GETs time out quickly via `api-resilience.ts` (`fetchJsonSafe`).
- **Verification**: `frontend/src/lib/verifications.ts` → `POST /verify`, `/verifications`, `/verifications/jobs/{id}`, SSE `/events`, WebSocket `/ws`, `/verifications/{slug}`, `/verifications/search`; progress helper `verification-progress.ts`. Reads degrade safely; submit still requires a live API.
- **Demo fallback**: Rich story payloads in `demo-data.ts` (`DEMO_STORIES`, `BD_SOURCES`, `DEMO_RUMOR_ARTICLES`); `stories.ts` merges API clusters with demo by slug and falls back when the API is down or empty. UI signals offline/demo with `ApiDegradedBanner` (`fromApi` flags).
- **Home feed**: `/` — Bangla hero, **`HeaderBanglaDate`**, topic-filtered **`HomeStoryGridClient`** → **`GET /api/feed/top`** (ETag via **`feed-etag.ts`**); home cards use **`StoryFeedCard`** **`variant="home"`**. **Chrome**: **`SiteHeader`** wordmark + English tagline (Bangla calendar date on home, not in header). **Story detail**: **`StoryDetailPanel`** + **`GET /api/story/[slug]`** (ETag + **`client-story-cache.ts`** + **`client-story-hydrate.ts`**). **Bengali titles**: **`mixed-script-text.ts`** + **`stories.ts`** **`deriveTitleBn`** (normalize glued BN/Latin; prefer Bengali article headlines when cluster title is Latin). **Summaries**: **`applySourceDerivedSummaries`** → **`summaryBullets`** (**`anti-clickbait-summary.ts`**). Custom RSS in **`/admin`** only.
- **Pro on the client**: **`GET /api/me/pro`** (`subscription-access.ts`) for **`StoryFollowButton`** / home feed cards; followed slugs in **`followed-stories.ts`** (localStorage until backend alerts ship).
- **Resilience**: `app/error.tsx` + `global-error.tsx` (`reloadOnceOnChunkError` from `chunk-load-error.ts` after deploy/PWA chunk mismatches; dev layout unregisters stale service workers); **`app/not-found.tsx`**; segment **`loading.tsx`** on story/verify detail. `ClientErrorBoundary` on heavy client widgets (`StoryTabs`, `VerifyClaimForm`). Prefer extending `stories.ts` / `api.ts` / `verifications.ts` rather than fetching ad hoc in pages.

## RSS ingestion (backend)

- **Service**: `backend/app/services/rss_ingestion.py` — seed sources from `bd_sources_seed.py`, fetch feeds (`rss_parser.py` extracts optional **`image_url`** per entry), dedupe by article URL, cluster by title Jaccard similarity (72h lookback, threshold ~0.42). Cluster blurbs on the frontend come from RSS excerpts via **`source-digest.ts`** (`applySourceDerivedSummaries` in **`stories.ts`**) — ingest no longer calls **`ai_client.summarize_cluster`**.
- **CLI**: `npm run ingest:backend` → `backend/scripts/ingest_rss.py` (requires `DATABASE_URL`; ORM tables + SQL migrations on API startup).
- **API**: `POST /api/v1/ingest` in `app/api/ingest.py`; optional `INGEST_API_KEY` env → require `X-Ingest-Key` header; async via Celery when `REDIS_URL` + `INGEST_ASYNC_ENABLED`.
- **Ops hooks**: `app/services/ops_alerts.py` — Healthchecks.io start/success/fail pings and optional Telegram summaries on ingest; wired from `ingest.py` and `scripts/ingest_rss.py`. All no-ops when env vars are unset.
- **Scheduled ingest**: `app/services/ingest_schedule.py` + `app_settings` (`backend/migrations/003_app_settings.sql`) — admin-set interval (15m–24h); Celery beat task `scheduled_ingest_tick` (every 60s) enqueues or runs ingest when due when `REDIS_URL` + `INGEST_SCHEDULER_ENABLED`; `npm run worker:beat` or compose **`beat`** service.

## Claim verification (backend + UI)

- **Submit (product)**: `POST /api/v1/verify` (`app/api/verify.py`) — sanitize text/URL, `ai_guardrails`, semantic cache hit → instant result; else queue job (`verification_jobs` + Celery `verification` queue or `BackgroundTasks`).
- **API surface**: `app/api/verifications.py` — create/list/search/get by slug, job status, **SSE** (`/jobs/{id}/events`) and **WebSocket** (`/jobs/{id}/ws`) for progress.
- **Pipeline**: `verification_submit`, `verification_runner`, `verification_pipeline`, `semantic_cache`, `embeddings`; SQL extras in `backend/migrations/001_verified_claims_pgvector_fts.sql` via `db_extensions.apply_sql_migrations`.
- **Frontend**: `/verify` (`VerifyClaimForm`), `/verify/[slug]`, `/verify/database` (`ClaimSearch`); discoverability via **`AuthNav`** (signed-in menu), not primary links in **`SiteHeader`**.

## Admin ops (internal)

- **Backend**: `GET /api/v1/admin/overview` — counts, per-source stats (incl. **`disabled`**), recent clusters, **`ingest_schedule`**, AI provider + key flags (`admin_stats.py`). **`GET/PATCH /api/v1/admin/ingest-schedule`** — read/update pull interval stored in **`app_settings`**. `POST/DELETE /api/v1/admin/sources` — add or remove RSS sources (`admin_sources.py`: DELETE **purges** that source’s articles and orphan clusters, then **soft-disables** seed feeds or **hard-deletes** custom rows; POST with same name re-enables disabled seed/custom). **`POST /api/v1/admin/sources/{source_id}/ingest`** — pull one feed (`run_rss_ingest_for_source`). When `ADMIN_API_KEY` is set, require header `X-Admin-Key`.
- **Frontend**: production admin UI on **`admin.shorup.news`** (`admin-host.ts`; main site redirects `/admin`); local dev at `/admin`. Page gate via legacy cookie (`ADMIN_PASSWORD` + `admin-auth.ts`) **or** Supabase user with `app_metadata.role=admin` / `ADMIN_EMAILS` allowlist. Public: `/admin/login`, `/admin/register` (`ADMIN_REGISTRATION_CODE`). Server proxies: `app/api/admin/login`, `logout`, `ingest`, **`ingest-schedule`**, `register`, `verify`, **`overview`**, **`users`**, **`users/[id]`**, `sources` — RSS/ingest/schedule via `lib/admin-api.ts` + **`ingest-schedule.ts`** (`ADMIN_API_KEY` / `INGEST_API_KEY`); Supabase user admin via `lib/admin-users.ts` (service role). **`GET /api/admin/overview`** uses **`isAdminRouteAuthorized`** and returns **`{ overview, apiHealthy }`**. Sources, ingest, **ingest-schedule**, and user CRUD proxies still require legacy **`shorup_admin`** (`verifyAdminSession`). UI: tabbed **`AdminDashboardPanel`** (`components/admin/`) — Overview, General (**`AdminIngestPanel`** schedule + manual ingest, **`AdminSourcesPanel`**), System (`buildAdminSystemInfo`), Users (`AdminUsersPanel`), Issues (`collectAdminIssues`); `AdminLogoutButton`; optional `NEXT_PUBLIC_BACKEND_DOCS_URL` for OpenAPI link.
- **Seed vs custom RSS**: `seed-source-names.ts` mirrors `bd_sources_seed.py`; `isCustomRssSource` distinguishes admin-added feeds from seed names (backend `GET /sources?custom_only=true`).
- **Env**: document in `backend/.env.example` and `frontend/.env.example`; never expose admin secrets as `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`.

